  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Systems Connect: Connecting UK experts with partner countries to enhance health diplomacy and strengthen health systems for all.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building upon the global brand of the NHS and the UK&#x2019;s global reputation in health systems strengthening, this programme will provide posts and host governments with access to British health expertise through technical exchange with experts working across the UK&#x2019;s health policy, planning and delivery ecosystem accessed through a single &#x201C;one stop shop&#x201D; &#x2013; the NHS Consortium for Global Health (NHS C), complementing wider efforts to support countries across the official development assistance (ODA) eligible FCDO network to achieve universal health coverage by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
